Redesign web dashboard, fix launcher, and fix confirmed code bugs

Web dashboard redesign ("Compositor" editorial aesthetic)
- Rewrite base.html design system: warm paper palette, vermilion accent,
  Fraunces/Hanken Grotesk/JetBrains Mono type system, paper grain overlay
- Replace dark Bootstrap navbar with a broadsheet masthead and add
  path-based active-link highlighting; add {% block head_extra %}
- Restyle shared classes + Bootstrap components so the look cascades to
  every page; staggered page-load reveal (respects reduced-motion)
- Give index.html an editorial masthead hero and section rules

start-web.sh launcher
- Call openrouter-venv/bin/python by path instead of sourcing activate
  (the activate script hardcoded a stale Dropbox VIRTUAL_ENV)
- Export PYTHONPATH=src early so the local source is imported
- Remove the legacy create_templates step (wrote to an unused ./templates/)
- Serve on port 3849 via a single PORT variable

Bug fixes (each added a focused regression test; full suite green, no regressions)
- chain runner: implement multi-pass execution (passes:N now runs N times
  with content chaining), execute postscript after a successful step
  (failure logged, not fatal), and wire output_append / per-step append
  accumulation (skip the final overwrite when accumulating)
- chain runner: copy file_size_validation config before applying step-level
  overrides so they no longer leak into shared config; sanitize prompt names
  in intermediate filenames; remove dead duplicate _get_intermediate_filename
- chain restart: persist each completed step's output path in the .status
  file and resume from it (the per-run temp dir made the old lookup fail);
  guard get_restart_point against non-numeric step keys; make
  update_step_complete/failed create the entry if missing
- api_client: configurable request timeout defaulting to 300s (was 30s, which
  aborted long generations); validate choices/message before indexing
- file_converter: refuse to overwrite the source file, reject zero-byte
  pandoc output as failure, normalize tex -> latex
- split_chapters: plain-text heading patterns no longer match prose lines;
  roman_to_int rejects non-canonical numerals
- config_manager: deep-merge nested config dicts so partial overrides keep
  sibling defaults
- web: add path-traversal containment to prompt file routes, confine
  scene-settings writes to project_root/.scene_settings, restrict chat/scene
  local endpoints to loopback (SSRF), confine chain config_path/output_file
  to the temp dir, and capture chain subprocess output to a log file
- remove dead, unreferenced prompt_runner_cli.py
